---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="AI Automation for HVAC | The One Group" 
  description="AI automation for HVAC companies: missed-call recovery, dispatch scheduling, follow-up, and seasonal campaigns. Recover the $2,000+/mo you lose to missed calls. Free discovery call."
>
  <!-- JSON-LD -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Service",
    "name": "AI Automation for HVAC — The One Group",
    "serviceType": "AI Automation for HVAC & Home Services",
    "provider": {
      "@type": "LocalBusiness",
      "name": "The One Group",
      "url": "https://theonegroup.info/",
      "telephone": "+17547998676",
      "email": "akennedy@theonegroup.info",
      "priceRange": "$$"
    },
    "description": "Custom AI automation for HVAC companies: missed-call recovery, dispatch scheduling, quote follow-up, and seasonal maintenance campaigns.",
    "areaServed": "South Florida, Miami, United States"
  })} />
  
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 via-white to-brand-50/30 dark:from-gray-950 dark:via-gray-950 dark:to-brand-950/20 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-40 -right-40 w-[500px] h-[500px] rounded-full bg-brand-200/20 dark:bg-brand-900/10 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none" />
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest">For HVAC Companies</span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-display font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.08] mt-4 mb-6">
          AI Automation for <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 via-brand-500 to-accent-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">HVAC Companies</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
          A missed call is a missed job — and when a unit's down, the customer calls the next company on the list. 
          AI answers instantly, recovers missed calls, and keeps your dispatch and follow-up on autopilot.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-accent-500 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
            Get a Free Missed-Call Audit
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" /></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="tel:7547998676" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 border-2 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 hover:border-brand-500 transition-all duration-200">
            Call (754) 799-8676
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- The missed-call claim -->
  <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14">
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest">The Missed-Call Problem</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold mt-3 mb-4">You're Losing $2,000+ Every Month</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          The average HVAC company loses <span class="font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200">$2,000+ every month</span> to missed calls alone. 
          When a customer has a broken AC in a Miami summer, they don't wait — they call the next company. 
          Every unreturned call is a job you never got to bid on.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="card p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3">Missed-Call Recovery</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">An AI agent answers every call — after hours, on weekends, or when your dispatcher is juggling three phones. It captures the job details, qualifies the urgency, and books a dispatch.</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 mt-4">Outcome: every call captured</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3">Dispatch Scheduling</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Calls routed to the right tech by service area and urgency. Appointments confirmed automatically, so your dispatch team knows exactly who's coming and when.</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 mt-4">Outcome: efficient dispatch</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3">Quote Follow-Up</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">After a site visit, quotes and estimates get followed up automatically. A customer who doesn't respond gets a personalized nudge until they decide — because in HVAC, the follow-up wins the job.</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 mt-4">Outcome: more jobs won</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3">Seasonal Campaigns</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Automated tune-up reminders before summer and winter peak seasons. Past customers get nudged to book maintenance — filling your calendar before demand spikes.</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-4">Outcome: predictable bookings</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- What you get -->
  <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14">
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Measurable Outcomes</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold mt-3 mb-4">Automation Results for HVAC</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="card p-8 text-center">
          <p class="text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-brand-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent font-display">Recover</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-3 mb-2">Missed-Call Revenue</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Turn the $2,000+/mo you currently lose into booked jobs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8 text-center">
          <p class="text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent font-display">24/7</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-3 mb-2">Lead Coverage</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Your business never goes home. Peak-season calls are answered instantly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8 text-center">
          <p class="text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-600 to-brand-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent font-display">More</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-3 mb-2">Repeat Jobs</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Seasonal campaigns turn one-time repairs into loyal maintenance customers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-widest">FAQ</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold mt-3 mb-4">HVAC Automation — Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="card p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">How much do missed calls really cost?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Industry benchmarks and our own analysis put the cost of missed and unreturned calls at $2,000+ per month for a typical HVAC company. In South Florida's peak season, it's often higher.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">Will the AI handle emergency calls well?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Yes. For urgent, after-hours situations the AI captures the job, qualifies urgency, and routes it to your on-call tech immediately — so nobody waits for business hours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">Does this work with my dispatch software?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Almost always. We integrate with the dispatch and scheduling tools most HVAC companies already use. We'll confirm during your free audit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">What does it cost?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Our audit starts at $2,500, and custom implementation typically runs $2,500&ndash;$10,000 depending on scope. Most clients recover the cost within the first quarter.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold mb-4">Stop Losing Jobs to Missed Calls</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8">
        Book a free discovery call. We'll estimate exactly how much missed-call revenue your company can recover.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-accent-500 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
        Book a Free Call
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" /></svg>
      </a>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-4">
        Or call <a href="tel:7547998676" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 font-medium underline underline-offset-2">(754) 799-8676</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
